        "content": "What function calculates the expiration profit or loss of a purchased call option on a Treasury bond based on strike yield, expiration yield, premium, and a fixed contract multiplier, using the option payoff max(expiration yield − strike yield, 0) minus the premium and rounding the result to the nearest integer?",
