      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    strike_yield = 3.0\n    premium = 1.5\n    yield_at_expiry = 3.5\n    multiplier = 100\n\n    # Calculate the call's intrinsic value and subtract the premium paid\n    intrinsic_value = max(0, yield_at_expiry - strike_yield) * multiplier\n    profit_or_loss = intrinsic_value - (premium * multiplier)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(profit_or_loss)\n```",
